  9   4010              IM2_TABLE EQU $C200             ; 257 bytes of $C3: every vector is $C3C3
 10   4010              IM2_JUMP  EQU $C3C3             ; and there, a JP to the routine
 11   4010              ; Three texts, one in each third of the screen, printed again and again while
 12   4010              ; the frame's interrupt comes in mode 2; its routine reads the status and
 13   4010              ; counts the frames.
 14   4010              ; The interrupts are off for the address and every byte of a text,
 15   4010              ; and the routine prints the count of frames on the last row.
 16   4010              ticks   EQU VARS + $10          ; frames, counted by the interrupt routine
 17   4010              turns   EQU VARS + $12          ; turns of the main loop
 18   4010              which   EQU VARS + $14          ; the text being printed, 1 to 3
